# ============================ Introduction ================================ #
# Output file for EM transition strengths calculation.
# All energies are in MeV.
# All times in ps.
# ME = matrix element in unit, like efm.
# tsp = single particle half-life in ps (default ICC = 0. tsp = tsp/(1+ICC)).
# BEM(↑) = B in unit e2fm2 for de-excitation.
# BWu(↑) = B in W.u. for de-excitation.
# ========================================================================== #


